cue0069085
00:09:19.000 --> 00:09:24.000
The Tora tells us exactly how, what are the laws for collective organization.

cue0069086
00:09:25.000 --> 00:09:26.000
How to have a sane community.

cue0069087
00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:28.000
